<title>BELARUS: Belarus Jan industrial output unchanged from Dec.</title>
<headline>Belarus Jan industrial output unchanged from Dec.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus January industrial output was unchanged from December in inflation-adjusted terms, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p>    BELARUS INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     Jan 97  Dec 96  Jan 96</p>
<p>     month/month pct change	    0.0    -0.8     N/A</p>
<p>     year/year pct change	    +14.0    +6.1    -8.8</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
